WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.636
-With COVID cases
once again on the rise,

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:06.206
especially in places where
vaccination rates have lagged,

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:08.141
the GOP and Fox News
have been freaking out

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:11.110
about President Biden's plan
to conduct community outreach

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.912
to raise awareness
about the vaccines.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.515
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:18.918 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.887
Yesterday was a big day
at the White House.

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.388
Pop star Olivia Rodrigo

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.924
met with President Biden
and Dr. Anthony Fauci

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.460
to promote COVID vaccines
among young people.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.263
And in addition to providing
a much-needed boost

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.231
to efforts to get
more people vaccinated,

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:34.000
it also gave us
the gift of Fauci,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.535
one of our most beloved
and celebrated scientists,

00:00:36.535 --> 00:00:39.939
explaining to the best
of his ability who Rodrigo is.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:43.009
-You're going to meet with
singer Olivia Rodrigo tomorrow

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.043
at the White House.

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:45.478
What do you think
that she can do

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:50.049
to try to persuade younger
people to get vaccinated?

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:53.386
-Well, I understand that
she's a very popular figure

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.021
among young individuals.

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:58.524
-That sounds like one of those
weird next generation episodes

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.994
where Data is explaining
to Riker who Elvis Presley was.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:04.764
"He was an influential musician
of the mid-20th century.

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.267
Apparently,
he died on a toilet."

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:08.801
Of course, you can't blame Fauci

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.336
for not always keeping up
with the times.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.171
He's an 80-year-old
immunologist.

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:15.107
Fauci's idea of a pop star
is probably Eddie Cantor.

00:01:15.107 --> 00:01:16.542
"We need to reach out
to young people.

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:18.211
Any ideas, Dr. Fauci?"

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:20.513
"What about Bobby Goldsboro?

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:23.449
Mel Tormé?
Oh, and can we get Perry Como?"

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:26.619
Fauci doesn't know anything
about modern music,
nor should he.

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.921
He probably knows
Leonard Bernstein
and that's it,

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:30.089
which is fitting since,

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:31.557
when he goes back
to his old neighborhood,

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:33.993
he probably acts
like a character from
"West Side Story."

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:36.529
"Hey, it's Tony the Fauch!
Looking good, Fauch!"

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.931
"Right back at ya, Mickey."
"Tony, watch out.

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:40.399
The Republicans
are looking for you."

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:43.169
"Hey, don't worry, Artie.
The Fauch ain't no slouch."

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.937
♪ Fauci, Fauci ♪

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:47.240
♪ Crazy Fauci ♪

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.942
Anyway...

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.843
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:53.345
This was a genuinely great

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:55.481
and admirable thing
that Rodrigo did.

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:57.983
We desperately need
as many trusted sources

00:01:57.983 --> 00:01:59.853
across a wide swath
of society

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.620
to raise awareness
about the vaccines

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.389
and push back against

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:06.392
all the toxic misinformation
pushed by the right.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:07.926
And if you watched
her comments yesterday,

00:02:07.926 --> 00:02:10.496
I think you'd agree
that Rodrigo was very effective

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:11.931
at getting the message out.

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:14.333
-I am beyond honored
and humbled to be here today

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:15.868
to help spread the message

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:18.938
about the importance
of youth vaccination.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:22.208
I'm in awe of the work
President Biden and
Dr. Fauci have done

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.843
and was happy to help
lend my support

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.912
to this important
initiative.

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:27.346
It's important
to have conversations

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:28.748
with friends
and family members

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:31.283
encouraging all communities
to get vaccinated

00:02:31.283 --> 00:02:33.019
and actually get
to a vaccination site,

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:35.288
which you can do more easily
than ever before,

00:02:35.288 --> 00:02:37.991
given how many sites we have
and how easy it is to find them

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:39.759
at vaccines.gov.

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:41.261
Side note here -- It's nice

00:02:41.261 --> 00:02:42.862
to see a real celebrity
at the White House

00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:45.030
after the last four years,
when the previous President

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.432
could only manage
to dig up the likes

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:47.900
of Ted Nugent or Scott Baio.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.103
Biden's got huge celebrities
helping him out

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:52.738
with an unprecedented
nation-wide campaign

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:55.174
to get Americans vaccinated
against the deadly disease.

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:58.044
And all Trump could muster
was 18 holes with Kid Rock

00:02:58.044 --> 00:03:00.012
in his flag pants,
which looks like something

00:03:00.012 --> 00:03:02.415
you'd buy for 6 bucks
at a truck stop

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:04.383
because you tore the ass
out of your good pants

00:03:04.383 --> 00:03:05.951
rock climbing on peyote.

00:03:05.951 --> 00:03:08.688
You might be asking yourself,
"They sell pants
at truck stops?"

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:10.322
Uh, yeah.

00:03:10.322 --> 00:03:12.158
You think truckers
go cross-country

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:13.826
wearing one pair of pants
the whole time?

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:15.094
Get real.

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:17.830
That is, unless they buy
my new product, Perma-Pants.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.298
And if you're wondering
how I'm gonna sell them,

00:03:19.298 --> 00:03:21.300
I'm going to grow a mustache
and start talking like this.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.469
"The best thing
about Perma-Pants

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:25.370
is you can go on the go,

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:27.874
and you don't have to pull over
and pee in the woods

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:31.210
and risk getting eaten
by da bears."

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.746
I made so much money
from Perma-Pants,

00:03:33.746 --> 00:03:38.017
I was able to buy a diamond ring
from Da Bears.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.853
I also bought some earrings
for my wife, Deborah.

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:43.422
And then the salesman asked
what they were for,

00:03:43.422 --> 00:03:46.859
and I said, 'Deb's ears.'"

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:51.464
You see...
what happened here

00:03:51.464 --> 00:03:53.866
is Shoemaker
texted us last night

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.802
and said, "FYI, plenty of time
for tomorrow's 'Closer Look.'"

00:03:56.802 --> 00:03:59.271
And we said,
"Challenge accepted."

00:03:59.271 --> 00:04:00.573
I mean, Shoemaker,
why would you do that?

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:02.608
That's like texting
a recovering alcoholic,

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:04.610
"No line at the bar."

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:06.212
The whole reason
I went to impression camp

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:07.613
was so I could stop
doing impressions.

00:04:07.613 --> 00:04:09.882
And you come along
like a drug dealer saying,

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:11.751
"Psst, hey, kid,
want to do a Lindell?

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:13.186
How about a Tony the Fauch?"

00:04:13.186 --> 00:04:15.655
By the way, Shoemaker
also went to tangent camp.

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:17.090
And if you want to know
how to get there,

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:21.193
you take a hard left, and then
you just keep [bleep] going.

00:04:21.193 --> 00:04:25.130
Now, part of the reason
the appearance from Rodrigo

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.899
was necessary and valuable

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:29.168
was that it will hopefully
help push back

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:31.170
against vaccine misinformation
being pushed

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.605
by the GOP
and right-wing media.

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:34.640
For example, they've recently
started claiming

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.343
that Joe Biden's plan to conduct
targeted community outreach

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:39.579
and go door-to-door to raise
awareness about vaccines

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:42.181
is actually a sinister
government effort

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:43.783
to take your guns
and your Bibles

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.818
and force you to take
whatever medication

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:47.353
the government
wants you to take.

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:49.822
-And now they're starting
to talk about going door-to-door

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:52.057
to be able to take vaccines
to the people.

00:04:52.057 --> 00:04:54.193
Think about the mechanisms
they would have to build

00:04:54.193 --> 00:04:56.896
to be able to actually execute
that massive of a thing,

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:58.764
and then think about
what those mechanisms

00:04:58.764 --> 00:05:00.233
could be used for.
They could then go door-to-door,

00:05:00.233 --> 00:05:03.168
take your guns, again go door
to door, take your Bibles."

00:05:03.168 --> 00:05:06.472
-Don't come knocking on my door
with your Fauci ouchie.

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:08.808
You leave us the hell alone.

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:11.244
-Going door-to-door?
This is creepy stuff.

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:13.178
You know, if someone
comes up to your door

00:05:13.178 --> 00:05:17.450
outside wearing a mask,
showing up at your house,

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:19.352
claiming to work
for the government,

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:21.553
asking you personal
medical questions?

00:05:21.553 --> 00:05:25.857
-Can HHS force you to take
antibiotics for your TB?

00:05:25.857 --> 00:05:27.659
How about Xanax
for your anxiety?

00:05:27.659 --> 00:05:29.862
Thorazine for your mania?

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:32.064
And while we're at it, why
are we letting irresponsible,

00:05:32.064 --> 00:05:34.066
defective people reproduce --

00:05:34.066 --> 00:05:36.735
vagrants, mental patients,
even QAnon people?

00:05:36.735 --> 00:05:38.671
All are allowed
to have children.

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:41.941
Why is that?
Why aren't we sterilizing them?

00:05:41.941 --> 00:05:43.342
Sound crazy?

00:05:43.342 --> 00:05:44.743
-What else
can the government do?

00:05:44.743 --> 00:05:46.311
Can they force you
to take aspirin

00:05:46.311 --> 00:05:48.281
when you have a headache?
Can they strap you down

00:05:48.281 --> 00:05:50.383
and slather you in Bengay
if your back hurts?

00:05:50.383 --> 00:05:53.519
Can they have mall security
drag you out of Brookstone

00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:55.688
for spending too much time
in the massage chair,

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.823
even though you show them
a doctor's note

00:05:57.823 --> 00:05:59.658
that says you have
an enlarged tailbone

00:05:59.658 --> 00:06:01.127
and you have
a constitutional right

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:03.362
to sit in the electric massage
chair for as long as you want?

00:06:03.362 --> 00:06:04.863
And then they say,
"That's not a doctor's note.

00:06:04.863 --> 00:06:06.198
It's written on a Post-it,"
and everyone

00:06:06.198 --> 00:06:07.900
in the store laughs,
and you say, "Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.336
I guess because my doctor
works out of a Staples,

00:06:10.336 --> 00:06:11.870
I'm not
an American citizen anymore."

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.205
And while everyone's
busy laughing,

00:06:13.205 --> 00:06:15.941
you try to fish some quarters
out of the mall fountain,

00:06:15.941 --> 00:06:17.577
and they say,
"You can't do that.

00:06:17.577 --> 00:06:19.145
And you say, "Well, how else
am I supposed to buy

00:06:19.145 --> 00:06:20.712
a box of garlic knots
from Sbarro?"

00:06:20.712 --> 00:06:22.748
And they say, "There's
no Sbarro at this mall.

00:06:22.748 --> 00:06:24.584
It was replaced by
B. Dalton Booksellers."

00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:27.553
And you say, "Well,
welcome to Joe Biden's America."

00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:29.355
And as you're saying it,
you fall ass first

00:06:29.355 --> 00:06:30.890
into the fountain
and nearly drown

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:33.993
until the mall cop
revives you by doing CPR

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:37.530
without getting
your permission first.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:40.299
Does that sound crazy to you?

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:41.868
Also, can we go back to this?

00:06:41.868 --> 00:06:44.170
-Going door-to-door?
This is creepy stuff.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.204
You know, if someone
comes up to your door

00:06:46.204 --> 00:06:49.975
outside wearing a mask,
showing up at your house,

00:06:49.975 --> 00:06:52.244
claiming to work
for the government,

00:06:52.244 --> 00:06:54.480
asking you personal
medical questions?

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.381
-Well, you can make
anything sound creepy

00:06:56.381 --> 00:06:57.983
when you say it like that.

00:06:57.983 --> 00:07:00.118
Someone comes up to your door
wearing high socks,

00:07:00.118 --> 00:07:01.454
short shorts, and a bucket hat,

00:07:01.454 --> 00:07:03.422
opens your mailbox,
takes all the outgoing mail,

00:07:03.422 --> 00:07:05.123
puts it in a van
that looks suspiciously like

00:07:05.123 --> 00:07:06.525
an ice cream truck,
and drives it away,

00:07:06.525 --> 00:07:08.527
I know you're not
the ice cream man.

00:07:08.527 --> 00:07:10.262
You're not fooling me,
government.

00:07:10.262 --> 00:07:12.831
In reality,
it is a volunteer effort.

00:07:12.831 --> 00:07:15.401
And all they're doing
is trying to raise awareness

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:18.104
about life-saving vaccines
amid a deadly pandemic.

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:20.339
And look, I get that
if you still

00:07:20.339 --> 00:07:23.108
don't have the vaccine
and you watch Fox News,

00:07:23.108 --> 00:07:24.910
you are not
going to be convinced

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.311
by someone
knocking on your door.

00:07:26.311 --> 00:07:28.080
But it's still nice
that they're trying.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.515
It's not like they're working
on commission

00:07:29.515 --> 00:07:30.749
or trying to get you
to upgrade to

00:07:30.749 --> 00:07:33.085
Pfizer's
Pfriends &amp; Pfamily Plan.

00:07:33.085 --> 00:07:35.053
Everyone just wants
this pandemic to end.

00:07:35.053 --> 00:07:36.856
And the fastest way out
is the vaccine.

00:07:36.856 --> 00:07:39.157
COVID cases in the U.S.
have doubled in recent weeks,

00:07:39.157 --> 00:07:41.127
and CBS reported a few days ago

00:07:41.127 --> 00:07:43.863
that almost all of
the new cases, 99.7% percent,

00:07:43.863 --> 00:07:45.597
are among people
who have not been vaccinated.

00:07:45.597 --> 00:07:47.533
It's tragic,
and it's unnecessary.

00:07:47.533 --> 00:07:49.101
We have an abundance
of safe, effective,

00:07:49.101 --> 00:07:50.769
and free vaccines
for anyone who wants one.

00:07:50.769 --> 00:07:52.905
And yet, the right
has even gone so far

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:55.407
as to insist that Democrats
or the media

00:07:55.407 --> 00:07:56.842
or anyone who wants to combat

00:07:56.842 --> 00:07:58.811
the spread
of this deadly disease

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:01.414
is somehow addicted
to the pandemic.

00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:03.815
-They just can't let
the pandemic go.

00:08:03.815 --> 00:08:05.350
At some point, it's --

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:08.987
they're going to have to
break the addiction.

00:08:08.987 --> 00:08:10.756
-Well, and it's like
some of these people

00:08:10.756 --> 00:08:12.591
get put out there all the time

00:08:12.591 --> 00:08:15.894
when they have been dead wrong
over the last year.

00:08:15.894 --> 00:08:17.896
-Hmm. And then when you say,
"Some of these people

00:08:17.896 --> 00:08:19.364
have been dead wrong,"
are you referring to the guy

00:08:19.364 --> 00:08:21.867
who said a deadly plant toxin
could cure coronavirus

00:08:21.867 --> 00:08:23.335
or the guy who said last year

00:08:23.335 --> 00:08:25.070
that COVID deaths
are almost nothing

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.206
or the guy who said we could
cure coronavirus

00:08:27.206 --> 00:08:29.141
by eating Tide To Go sticks
like French fries

00:08:29.141 --> 00:08:31.310
and complimented a doctor
who believes in demon sperm?

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:34.146
Remember that? I mean, how
could you forget demon sperm?

00:08:34.146 --> 00:08:36.081
Sounds like the name
of a monster truck

00:08:36.081 --> 00:08:39.251
or a knockoff energy drink you'd
find at the counter at a bodega.

00:08:39.251 --> 00:08:42.421
Also, do you think
we can't quit the pandemic?

00:08:42.421 --> 00:08:43.889
Are you insane?

00:08:43.889 --> 00:08:45.658
I'm so sick of this pandemic.
When it's over,

00:08:45.658 --> 00:08:48.527
I'm going to celebrate by going
to a giant indoor concert

00:08:48.527 --> 00:08:50.429
where we all burn our masks,

00:08:50.429 --> 00:08:52.097
drink ayahuasca
out of a shared cup,

00:08:52.097 --> 00:08:53.498
and make out with each other.

00:08:53.498 --> 00:08:55.500
We all want this God-forsaken
nightmare to be over with,

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.002
which is why we're trying
to convince people

00:08:57.002 --> 00:08:59.071
to get vaccinated,
but maddeningly,

00:08:59.071 --> 00:09:00.439
we're dealing with
a political movement

00:09:00.439 --> 00:09:02.374
that's made spreading lies
about vaccines

00:09:02.374 --> 00:09:04.276
one of their central
political projects.

00:09:04.276 --> 00:09:05.844
It's become a culture-war issue
for them.

00:09:05.844 --> 00:09:07.313
They're even selling merch now.

00:09:07.313 --> 00:09:08.714
-Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:12.351
introduced new coronavirus-
themed campaign merchandise.

00:09:12.351 --> 00:09:14.119
These are some of the items
being sold

00:09:14.119 --> 00:09:16.756
on the governor's official
campaign website.

00:09:16.756 --> 00:09:19.925
There's a drink koozie with
a quote from DeSantis asking,

00:09:19.925 --> 00:09:22.594
"How am I going to drink a beer
with a mask on?"

00:09:22.594 --> 00:09:24.329
And a T-shirt that reads,

00:09:24.329 --> 00:09:26.264
"Don't Fauci my Florida."

00:09:26.264 --> 00:09:27.700
-Cool.
So the Republican Party

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.503
is basically
just Hot Topic for boomers now.

00:09:30.503 --> 00:09:32.772
Florida is currently
reporting daily cases

00:09:32.772 --> 00:09:34.473
close to four times
the national average,

00:09:34.473 --> 00:09:36.275
with the second-highest number
in the country.

00:09:36.275 --> 00:09:37.610
And DeSantis is selling merch

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:40.812
like he's at a folding table
outside Warped Tour.

00:09:40.812 --> 00:09:43.415
Can't wait for DeSantis
to show up to his next interview

00:09:43.415 --> 00:09:45.318
in a new t-shirt
with a studded belt,

00:09:45.318 --> 00:09:47.552
a pierced nose,
and jet-black hair.

00:09:47.552 --> 00:09:50.789
And what does that even mean?
"Don't Fauci my Florida"?

00:09:50.789 --> 00:09:52.224
Is that supposed to be
a play on words?

00:09:52.224 --> 00:09:55.294
It sounds like a mad lib filled
out in a concussion ward.

00:09:55.294 --> 00:09:58.430
Also, poor Fauci. He's an
80-year-old New York doctor.

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:01.233
The natural next step for him
was to move to Florida.

00:10:01.233 --> 00:10:03.636
Now he can't.
Old New Yorkers move to Florida

00:10:03.636 --> 00:10:06.204
the way sea turtles migrate.
It's just instinct.

00:10:06.204 --> 00:10:08.173
One day they're at the top
of the subway stairs

00:10:08.173 --> 00:10:09.808
with a bag from Zabar's,

00:10:09.808 --> 00:10:11.577
and something in them
goes, "'F' it."

00:10:11.577 --> 00:10:12.878
Next thing they know,
they're in Boca

00:10:12.878 --> 00:10:17.216
putting a basket of seashells
on the back of a toilet.

00:10:17.216 --> 00:10:18.618
"I'm home."

00:10:18.618 --> 00:10:20.752
Every sane person
wants the pandemic to end

00:10:20.752 --> 00:10:22.855
as quickly as possible,
and the best way to do that

00:10:22.855 --> 00:10:25.358
is to get as many people
vaccinated as we can.

00:10:25.358 --> 00:10:28.694
We have an abundance of safe,
effective, and free vaccines

00:10:28.694 --> 00:10:30.162
available
for anyone who wants one.

00:10:30.162 --> 00:10:31.997
We just need to keep
getting the word out.

00:10:31.997 --> 00:10:33.432
Instead,
large parts of the right

00:10:33.432 --> 00:10:35.401
are spreading dangerous
lies about the vaccines.

00:10:35.401 --> 00:10:36.902
The sane political movement

00:10:36.902 --> 00:10:38.571
in this situation
would be doing the opposite.

00:10:38.571 --> 00:10:40.105
They'd be telling
the government, "Please"...

00:10:40.105 --> 00:10:43.108
-Come knocking on my door
with your Fauci ouchie.

00:10:43.108 --> 00:10:45.377
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:45.377 --> 00:10:48.780 line:0%
♪♪

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.583
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:10:50.583 --> 00:10:52.818
over two million meals a year
to men, women, and children

00:10:52.818 --> 00:10:55.521
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,
and other serious illnesses,

00:10:55.521 --> 00:10:57.623
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:10:57.623 --> 00:10:59.892
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:10:59.892 --> 00:11:02.762
Stay safe, get vaccinated.
We love you.

